nvidia-legacy-304xx-driver is a metapackage. It pulls in the runtime
libraries, the Xorg driver, the utilities, the kernel-support glue and (for the
DKMS flavour) the DKMS module source for NVIDIA 304.137.

Hardware: GeForce 6/7 series (NV4x, G7x)
Upstream status: Upstream EOL 2017-09. Kernel module forward-ported to Linux ~7.2 (import flydiscohuebr/nvidia-304 + adapt 390xx patches). X driver needs the private xorg-server-legacy-nvidia-23 (video ABI 23). See docs/legacy-feasibility.md.


To remove every trace:  apt purge '~nnvidia-legacy-304xx-.*'
